00:07:32.501 --> 00:07:39.196
&gt;&gt; India has been primarily value-based or
discount-based market.

00:07:39.196 --> 00:07:44.191
So most of the companies that
have gotten created in India have

00:07:44.191 --> 00:07:49.297
used discounting and
price as a primary means of competition.

00:07:49.297 --> 00:07:54.420
Now, when you do that, one of the big
drivers obviously is the need for capital.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:58.112
That is changing, partly I think
COVID has had a role to play, but

00:07:58.112 --> 00:08:01.614
the other thing is There is now more and

00:08:01.614 --> 00:08:07.464
more shift towards the consumer
