00:12:15.724 --> 00:12:22.667
&gt;&gt; In India, particularly the global firms
follow that more than the Indian firms.

00:12:22.667 --> 00:12:25.207
&gt;&gt; Okay, so next true false question.

00:12:25.207 --> 00:12:28.253
Lead investors will always ask for
