you would have to have been very,

00:12:49.097 --> 00:12:56.550
very diluted at the seed level
to have reached that position.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:13:01.322
So, the only time when we see that
is when companies struggle to

00:13:01.322 --> 00:13:03.226
scale at the seed level.

00:13:03.226 --> 00:13:06.299
Founders can overestimate latent demand,
and

00:13:06.299 --> 00:13:11.286
they end up struggling more to get to
a point where they are ready for series A,

00:13:11.286 --> 00:13:15.710
that does sometimes lead
